    Capital, Inc., a FINRA registered broker-dealer firm. The business address of FT Global Capital, Inc. is 1688 Meridian Avenue, Suite
    700, Miami Beach, FL 33139, United States.</P>
    <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</P>
