    common shares issuable upon exercise of certain warrants held by Mr. Fuad Alec Orudjev, General Counsel of FT Global Capital, Inc.
    The business address of FT Global Capital, Inc. is 1688 Meridian Avenue, Suite 700, Miami Beach, FL 33139, United States.</P></TD></TR>
