<TD STYLE="width: 3pc"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 1.5pc"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Symbol">&middot;</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">the price or prices at which the warrants may be exercised;</TD></TR></TABLE>

